        <div class="space-y-4 text-ink-soft">
          <p>Being a comp sec is one of the most time-consuming volunteer roles in a swimming club. Between tracking qualifying times, managing entries, chasing parents for confirmations, and updating PBs after every meet, it can eat up entire evenings.</p>
          <p>Swimly automates the mechanical parts so you can focus on the decisions that actually need a human: which swimmers should enter, which events to prioritise, and how to develop your squad's competition programme.</p>
          <p class="font-medium text-[#0F2D2D]">You don't need to be technical. If you can attach a file to an email, you can use Swimly's competition tools.</p>
